     3638         WITH SIZE 74 BY 16 separators.
     3639   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3640       dsp-rs  AT ROW 1 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     3641       b-help  AT ROW 1 COL 61
     3642       br-option AT ROW 2 COL 75
